 "look": "an undead man, a walking corpse with muddy olive-khaki grey skin, desaturated and warm, lank thin dark greasy hair lying flat on the scalp, a gaunt face and a lean, sinewy, wasted build with broad bony shoulders",
 "dome": "lank, thin, dark grey-brown greasy hair lying flat on the scalp, parted off-centre, its ragged ends reaching the brow, with one bare patch of scalp on the right of the picture carrying a pale-rimmed sore",
 "dome_cover_tilt": "hair",
 "torso_tilt": "first the top plane of the chest with its two pectoral muscles meeting at the breastbone, then, tucked under the chest, a short glimpse of the flat upper belly.",
 "torso_paint": "the torso as one lean bony chest with two flat thin pectoral muscles and a flat sunken upper belly below them",
 "face_paint": "the head as lank, thin, dark greasy hair lying flat on the scalp seen from above, covering the head as far as on the sculpt, parted off-centre, with the bare scalp patch and its dull pale-rimmed sore on the right of the picture exactly where the sculpt has it, and, in the narrow strip along the head's bottom edge exactly as small as on the sculpt, a gaunt face strongly foreshortened from above: heavy brow shadow, pale eyes just visible under the brow, the nose tip and a bloodied upper lip at the bottom edge",
 "arms_paint": "bony shoulders and collarbones across the shoulder band; level arms that are lean, sinewy and wasted, with thin stringy muscle under slack skin",
